368
00:30:45,680 --> 00:30:47,440
Bio sam poput, idi i uzmi novac, čovječe.

369
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:48,400
Ovo je sjajno.

370
00:30:48,480 --> 00:30:48,960
Uložio si trud.

371
00:30:49,200 --> 00:30:49,680
Zaslužio si ga.

372
00:30:50,080 --> 00:30:50,880
I to je tako cool.

373
00:30:51,520 --> 00:30:52,240
I volim te priče.

374
00:30:52,320 --> 00:30:56,480
Imali smo nekoliko njih u Cali Eyeu i to je dobra stvar.

375
00:30:56,800 --> 00:30:56,880
Da.

376
00:30:57,360 --> 00:30:58,960
Kako razmišljate o cijenama?

377
00:30:59,120 --> 00:31:00,080
